Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.41,0:01:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好懷念
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,這個交換日記持續了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊的回覆 讓人好期待
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.01,0:01:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,(繪圖日記)\N畫得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.55,0:01:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,來畫今天的份吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.51,0:01:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就畫來到海邊了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好嗎 光留
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.68,0:01:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊在笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:02:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,所以這是…夢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(繪畫比賽獎狀)\N(第二名 松來光留)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,(Inhuman)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,(1.無人性的 像怪物般)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,(2.沒有人情味)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,(3.冷酷的 殘酷的)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,《殺手旅店》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,(ParL Mart 8)\N(甜點祭)\N(委託20 機車日記1)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝惠顧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,菸又漲價了?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,物價到底怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能饒了我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,請給我27號
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.57,0:04:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,(殺手偵探)\N(店員推薦 角色抽獎)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,還有抽一次這個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,(角色抽獎)\N是這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,(角色抽獎)\N給您
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧 我忘記帶錢包了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.97,0:04:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我的全部財產 只有這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,該選哪一個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.46,0:05:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,您很喜歡殺手偵探吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,並沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,(殺手偵探)\N(店員推薦 角色抽獎)\N因為廣告牌很可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我對可愛的東西沒什麼抵抗力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.90,0:05:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,果然還是不要菸了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.19,0:05:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,請給我這…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,給您
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不是給您的 是借您的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,因為那個廣告牌是我畫的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,算是我的責任吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就不客氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,(恭喜中獎 SS獎)\N(請至店面兌換獎品)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,SS獎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,(SS獎玩偶)\NSS獎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,超可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.47,0:05:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.13,0:05:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,(松來)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,松來小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我超開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,總之我現在得想辦法回報妳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,您現在不是沒錢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,作為交換…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 她還不懂事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,還沒買怎麼可以拆開
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的很抱歉\N- 不然這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,這個我來買吧 剛好有找錢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那個…\N- 沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,以後盡可能牽著她的手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,牽我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.51,0:07:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前也是那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊為了不讓我走散
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,總是緊緊牽住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝您
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全沒注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,松來小姐妳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.61,0:07:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不要那麼輕易借錢給別人比較好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,大家不見得跟我一樣都是好人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.03,0:07:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,很可愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:07:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,別碰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.83,0:08:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這個500圓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在全部抽完之前 先借我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,可以是可以 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,求個好彩頭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A獎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,(A獎玩偶)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜您
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,妳今天下班了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我送妳回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎麼可能坐\N連名字都不知道的人的機車啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,桐原柴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:09:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,身邊的人都叫我小柴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.99,0:09:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小柴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,妳是松來?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.81,0:09:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(恭喜中獎 D獎)\N(請至店面兌換獎品)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,D獎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,(D獎玩偶)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜您
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,松來小姐 這個可愛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.85,0:09:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就當作很可愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,光留
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫松來光留
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,光留是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,妳也有這種東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,(ParL Mart 8)\N(甜點祭)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.11,0:10:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,菸灰缸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是常識嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.48,0:10:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,妳是做什麼工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.50,0:10:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我在旅店工作 負責接待客人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真意外
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,完全沒想到妳是上班族
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.03,0:10:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,因為妳不分晝夜都會來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.99,0:10:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,因為是排班制的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有早班也有晚班嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,跟超商沒什麼兩樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,妳從以前就很會畫畫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道以前怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不過姊姊常常誇獎我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.39,0:10:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那就代表很厲害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,松來小姐 請來收銀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,(殺手偵探)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.18,0:11:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,前陣子只有這些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼每天都在增加
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,妳還是一樣 很喜歡可愛的東西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.90,0:11:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,妳還記得啊 不愧是沙羅前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 生朗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是叫你別碰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小柴小姐 這是在哪裡買的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,這是在我喜歡的一家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,廣告牌很可愛的超商
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(美味肉包)\N抱歉 我接個電話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.39,0:12:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,(無生命跡象)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.61,0:12:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,(繪圖日記)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,《殺手旅店》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,(ParL Mart 8)\N(甜點祭)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.49,0:12:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,(美味肉包)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 小柴?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,妳又來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.41,0:13:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,抽獎明明已經全部結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.67,0:13:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因為全部結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我想把跟妳借的錢還給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.78,0:13:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我也全部結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.33,0:13:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我去火葬了姊姊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,妳看 我穿著喪服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很難接話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.59,0:13:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我自己先劇透
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:13:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就知道她活不久了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都在做準備
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但火葬結束 回到家後
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.69,0:14:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺很空虛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,因為她常常反覆住院出院
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.47,0:14:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,像是住院時的換洗衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.63,0:14:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,還有吃藥管理等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,當我不用再做任何一件事後
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就不知道該如何是好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才想去打工活動一下身體
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,(有一則新訊息)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,(繪圖日記)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小柴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才的錢 不用還了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,作為交換 我有一個請求
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.78,0:15:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,去海邊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,海邊?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,帶我去海邊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.26,0:15:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,要出發囉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.91,0:15:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼是海
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.29,0:15:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 聽不見
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.78,0:16:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼是海啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.78,0:16:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,風好涼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,妳有在聽我說話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.48,0:16:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,繪圖日記
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,聽不見
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,繪圖日記
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,小時候 我和姊姊一起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,寫過繪圖交換日記
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,結果在去海邊的那一天結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.66,0:16:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想起為什麼在那裡結束
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好險
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才想去海邊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,因為繪圖日記的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.76,0:16:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,已經無法問本人了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來 妳居然會答應
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在這種深夜裡 還是去海邊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一般來說 都會拒絕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.61,0:17:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在還人情罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.51,0:17:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,話說妳自己也知道這不正常啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,(殺手偵探)\N(店員推薦 角色抽獎)\N因為廣告牌很可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.18,0:17:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我對可愛的東西沒什麼抵抗力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.51,0:17:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.91,0:17:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,從現在開始 我要說的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,請不要聽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 完全聽不見
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我的姊姊叫滿留
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她非常擅長畫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.53,0:17:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊 姊姊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,妳看 我拿到了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:17:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,繪畫比賽第二名
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.81,0:18:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不過還是輸給姊姊的第一名了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.78,0:18:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是說過畫畫沒有分輸贏嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.73,0:18:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,拿第一名的人說這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,只是在挖苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.64,0:18:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜歡妳畫的畫了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,以後也要多畫畫喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.83,0:18:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,(鬼燈之詩)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,(封面·插畫 松來滿留)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.80,0:18:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊 電話響囉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:18:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,姊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,長的話兩年 短的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,從那個夏天開始
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊就不斷往返家裡和醫院
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.12,0:19:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,積蓄慢慢減少
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我開始打工
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.61,0:19:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,學校 打工 照顧病人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,學校 打工 照顧病人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之間 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,今年開始 姊姊的病情惡化了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.03,0:20:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,這大概是最後一次回來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,小柴 謝謝妳當作沒聽到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.62,0:21:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,妳在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我請妳喝咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.90,0:21:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,沙羅前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.49,0:21:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝妳代替我值晚班
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.27,0:21:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託妳囉 小柴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:22:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,(機車日記 下集待續)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.03,0:23:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,(下集 委託21 機車日記2)

